{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setKeyMode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"keyMode","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RFIDResult","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@RFIDManager@objc(cs)RFIDResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"keyMode","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0 or 1."},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"text","text":"0: Only lift keycode 1"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the fetch is successful, the data field of ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult"},{"text":" is Int.","type":"text"},{"text":"\n","type":"text"},{"text":"如果获取成功，","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.rfid.RFIDManager\/documentation\/RFIDManager\/RFIDResult"},{"text":"的data字段为Int.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"English","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"English"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The KeyMode parameter controls the trigger mode of the device’s scan key.","type":"text"},{"text":"\n","type":"text"},{"text":"When KeyMode = 0, the key value 1 will be returned in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keyUpBlock"},{"text":" callback of ","type":"text"},{"code":"RFIDBleManager.shared.setKeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the scan key is lift